      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: Install VS Code"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "e6d18ef1c1059c5cbc579e4a3d1d2677970824aa8e4538ea5c27b2cef4473d35",
      "target": "推荐使用 VS Code。它免费、能在各种操作系统上运行，对 Jupyter Notebook 的支持完善，扩展生态也覆盖了 AI 工作所需的功能。\n"
    },
    {
