      "source_sha256": "0d9f9653e3a51be93d1277f39750ac526e5dcfd98992b1ad473b495fedf8b605",
      "target": "如果 macOS 找不到 `code`，打开 VS Code，按 `Cmd+Shift+P`，输入“Shell Command”，然后选择“Install 'code' command in PATH”。\n"
    },
