      "target": "### 步骤 2：安装必需的扩展\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "410071474b6724c5971f8ba4b26133d69956a45e2bebaab33a25feab0d0f99ed",
      "target": "打开 VS Code 的集成终端（各平台均使用 `` Ctrl+` ``），安装 AI 工作所需的扩展：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0043",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "bbabbfe93fe60477fdbb5a90abab7575b24808b050e6d24e5e9f5e32e183de00",
      "target": "```bash\ncode --install-extension ms-python.python\ncode --install-extension ms-python.vscode-pylance\ncode --install-extension ms-toolsai.jupyter\ncode --install-extension eamodio.gitlens\ncode --install-extension ms-vscode-remote.remote-ssh\ncode --install-extension ms-python.debugpy\ncode --install-extension ms-python.black-formatter\ncode --install-extension charliermarsh.ruff\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "02bc025de523b5d3755d15b0422741f71c492f34a82db8f2ff483fe19acb75a2",
      "target": "各扩展的作用如下：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0046",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0047",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "3c4e7e3c8898b163c20bc9d2924a85bd498673a9a416a731db5a6514465f8498",
      "target": "| 扩展 | 用途 |\n|-----------|-----|\n| Python | 语言支持、虚拟环境检测、运行/调试 |\n| Pylance | 快速类型检查、自动补全、导入解析 |\n| Jupyter | 在 VS Code 中运行 Notebook、查看变量 |\n| GitLens | 查看谁修改了哪些内容，在代码旁显示 git blame 信息 |\n| Remote SSH | 像打开本地目录一样，打开远程 GPU 机器上的目录 |\n| Debugpy | 对 Python 代码进行单步调试 |\n| Black Formatter | 保存时自动格式化，保持风格一致 |\n| Ruff | 快速执行代码检查，发现常见错误 |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0048",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Install Essential Extensions"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
