    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "476e5ff621675391bb88ab8299310eb175d3f0f52f6034dfa481cb7cd1465456",
      "target": "### 步骤 3：配置设置\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0052",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "0cb8217f790247b6f7ec63945883695e97a3aa0d84e5d01c63c50dbafb79016b",
      "target": "复制本课 `code/.vscode/settings.json` 中的设置，或通过 `Settings > Open Settings (JSON)` 手动配置。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "b1d89e88101a5f231778f0bc9c0e7fe1de9ad4ba0965135e8f333a595bbee75d",
      "target": "AI 工作所需的关键设置：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0057",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "ff759899f80726cceafd5cf026bec94064270da3090396ba9ad5b97a410aecaa",
      "target": "```jsonc\n{\n    \"python.analysis.typeCheckingMode\": \"basic\",\n    \"editor.formatOnSave\": true,\n    \"editor.rulers\": [88, 120],\n    \"notebook.output.scrolling\": true,\n    \"files.autoSave\": \"afterDelay\"\n}\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0058",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "3f624eef8c351eff5ab5ce96cc4787ec6fd35262e2995d55a83e1bdf1152606a",
      "target": "这些设置为什么重要：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0060",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0061",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "7680db4cf5f8d130723534c803c349d3f1aab5ee6bfd1ac4b01228d36ff832a2",
      "target": "- **将类型检查设为 basic**：在运行前发现参数类型错误，减少排查张量形状不匹配和 API（应用程序编程接口）参数错误的时间。\n- **保存时格式化**：格式问题交给 Black 处理，不必再操心。\n- **在 88 和 120 列显示标尺**：Black 在 88 列处换行；120 列标尺帮助你发现过长的文档字符串和注释。\n- **Notebook 输出滚动**：训练循环会打印数千行内容；不启用滚动，输出面板就会不断膨胀。\n- **自动保存**：你可能忘记保存，导致训练脚本运行旧代码。自动保存可以避免这个问题。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0062",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Configure Settings"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "562e97030957a3913370ceb17e04a4d9874402e127f9061c33da2a23cfc612fe",
      "target": "### 步骤 4：集成终端\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0064",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "ec9563f1a1d633d62aa50e91931893c7396f9542dd7496e10cb720fcabdfdd60",
      "target": "你会在 VS Code 的集成终端中运行训练脚本、监控 GPU 和管理环境。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0066",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "28add4869817cbfb15f089133778df5e92ddf852d23a8ca5e1eabfbd42f29c14",
      "target": "合理配置：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0068",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0069",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "1a5a029f1ccb8ef9e7c7aa39ec26c651530f9f775ffdba43a6b9caed05819850",
      "target": "```jsonc\n{\n    \"terminal.integrated.defaultProfile.osx\": \"zsh\",\n    \"terminal.integrated.defaultProfile.linux\": \"bash\",\n    \"terminal.integrated.fontSize\": 13,\n    \"terminal.integrated.scrollback\": 10000\n}\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0070",
