      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "9c2c5564781c288784d73710697d8667823ed0caa619cacbf40761cc8ab1a769",
      "target": "实用快捷键：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0072",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0073",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "efbe188faee5f3fbf4d97d8bc85084284086898390c6e8d338b2749306b9ceef",
      "target": "| 操作 | macOS | Linux/Windows |\n|--------|-------|---------------|\n| 切换终端显示 | `` Ctrl+` `` | `` Ctrl+` `` |\n| 新建终端 | `` Ctrl+Shift+` `` | `` Ctrl+Shift+` `` |\n| 拆分终端 | `Cmd+\\` | `Ctrl+Shift+5` |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0074",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "84170a5b558bb9a43ec91d2acdad1ff7724b988cf505c2a0bb458920d72ff60b",
      "target": "拆分终端很实用：一个终端运行脚本，另一个用 `nvidia-smi -l 1` 或 `watch -n 1 nvidia-smi` 监控 GPU。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0076",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: Terminal Integration"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "9dbad94b5d1431169e4e66badfe3f55ba3d2c8606453826884c35b77a15754d5",
      "target": "### 步骤 5：远程开发（通过 SSH 连接 GPU 机器）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0078",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "c2c67779df46c107db9c7b5bdbd3cb3474c4fc41255249e562ea168ec211991b",
      "target": "这是 AI 工作最重要的扩展。你会在远程机器上训练模型，例如云虚拟机、实验室服务器、Lambda 或 Vast.ai。Remote SSH 让你能打开远程文件系统、编辑文件、使用终端和调试代码，就像所有内容都在本地一样。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0080",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "6f504474945d80ede854a25a7006b531d4a2a9fc2cd75b8f419ca7c8534a9a25",
      "target": "配置步骤：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0082",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0083",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 42,
      "source_sha256": "7ed7bff2d4486f4653bc820554e8d80170d36a8696d50055d39907b35e498e59",
      "target": "1. 安装 Remote SSH 扩展（步骤 2 中已完成）。\n2. 按 `Ctrl+Shift+P`（或 `Cmd+Shift+P`），输入“Remote-SSH: Connect to Host”。\n3. 输入 `user@your-gpu-box-ip`。\n4. VS Code 自动在远程机器上安装服务端组件。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0084",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 42,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 43,
      "source_sha256": "0152aa75e5d2a42e5b59687c2921131fd1e77a4f5be3d8a35d7d90a87b415b85",
      "target": "如需免密码访问，请配置 SSH 密钥：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0086",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 43,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0087",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 44,
      "source_sha256": "37eddd218b4b97d89512740c2d8b493a66dcaf3210618237925bc3336faddc80",
      "target": "```bash\nssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C \"your-email@example.com\"\nssh-copy-id user@your-gpu-box-ip\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0088",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 44,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 45,
      "source_sha256": "3b51c3151bd6dd8b7a9bb6a7d3deaa42bd52b581a9b7cee4f1c692a30a5d34f8",
      "target": "为方便使用，将主机加入 `~/.ssh/config`：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0090",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 45,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0091",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 46,
      "source_sha256": "45e9e41cfc0eca0645eba4ebed39d7b2c89e5c7a39fd4d7cd2e2747efcf77734",
      "target": "```text\nHost gpu-box\n    HostName 203.0.113.50\n    User ubuntu\n    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\n    ForwardAgent yes\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0092",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 46,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 47,
      "source_sha256": "6ebd9d6ebbdd1914a940700345a5c5ddcdd6d7924bc029bde83342ba58a0fc27",
      "target": "现在执行 `Remote-SSH: Connect to Host > gpu-box` 即可快速连接。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0094",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Remote Development (SSH into GPU Boxes)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 47,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
