      ],
      "ordinal": 53,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Alternatives",
        "### Vim/Neovim"
      ],
      "ordinal": 54,
      "source_sha256": "402e138a6b73d70709838a557c88e7e6a37476cf43be362b7da37ff454d8f5e7",
      "target": "如果你已经使用 Vim 或 Neovim，并且用得很熟练，就继续使用。AI Python 工作所需的最小配置如下：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0108",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Alternatives",
        "### Vim/Neovim"
      ],
      "ordinal": 54,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0109",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Alternatives",
        "### Vim/Neovim"
      ],
      "ordinal": 55,
      "source_sha256": "2e0e07281d60b341df1440658db75626829b3777af582d5928950bfdb30c5071",
      "target": "- 用 **pyright** 或 **pylsp** 进行类型检查（通过 Mason 或手动安装）\n- 用 **nvim-lspconfig** 集成语言服务器\n- 用 **jupyter-vim** 或 **molten-nvim** 实现类似 Notebook 的执行方式\n- 用 **telescope.nvim** 搜索文件/符号\n- 将 **none-ls.nvim** 与 black、ruff 配合，用于格式化/代码检查\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0110",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Alternatives",
        "### Vim/Neovim"
      ],
      "ordinal": 55,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Alternatives",
        "### Vim/Neovim"
      ],
      "ordinal": 56,
      "source_sha256": "18da02b6247408a1e82cd6debbd1e0965acbc7b2b1399af89a10803228dde0cd",
      "target": "如果你还没用过 Vim，先别在这时入门。学习它会分散学习 AI 工程的精力，使用 VS Code 即可。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0112",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
