      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0113",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 57,
      "source_sha256": "5ea8444f1e52d79d0fa5a9889d9e68b6f9378788af91764ac90a2934dcc50b2b",
      "target": "## 实际使用\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0114",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 57,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 58,
      "source_sha256": "61e25d8a22401bbb698607b7f8b08fc2b6e825f26fc13baf2572764c0835f387",
      "target": "配置完成后，你的日常工作流如下：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0116",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 58,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0117",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 59,
      "source_sha256": "a7e3db49be1eff243162543a3292b1499375ab55afc6c9f5c3c08eeb9ff22218",
      "target": "1. 在 VS Code 中打开项目目录，或通过 Remote SSH 连接 GPU 机器。\n2. 借助自动补全、类型提示和行内错误提示，在编辑器中编写 Python。\n3. 使用 Jupyter 扩展，直接在编辑器中运行 Jupyter Notebook。\n4. 在集成终端中运行训练脚本、执行 `uv pip install`，以及监控 GPU。\n5. 提交前用 GitLens 检查改动。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0118",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 59,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0119",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 60,
      "source_sha256": "a4807fe836e0096bcaf158b29f934e8fe31d4f4827549967dfe8f4f2fb831a64",
      "target": "## 练习\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0120",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 60,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0121",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 61,
      "source_sha256": "7df7501b768635568770fb528612b87bbde36b378befd1793b1f5e9ff8996664",
      "target": "1. 安装 VS Code 和步骤 2 列出的所有扩展\n2. 将本课的 `settings.json` 复制到你的 VS Code 配置中\n3. 打开一个 Python 文件，验证 Pylance 会显示类型提示，且 Black 会在保存时格式化\n4. 如果你可以访问远程机器，配置 Remote SSH 并打开其中的一个目录\n"
    },
    {
