    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0123",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Key Terms"
      ],
      "ordinal": 62,
      "source_sha256": "c9a48ecf34a7d8550efdf7b469e84d28521007a46a3bc08fc1e840691c760c42",
      "target": "## 关键术语\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0124",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Key Terms"
      ],
      "ordinal": 62,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-08:b0125",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Editor Setup",
        "## Key Terms"
      ],
      "ordinal": 63,
      "source_sha256": "a4fc2c32923cd50a5f8556c3d70b670d6fdf5d8a4d86dd87c982df55668baa39",
      "target": "| 术语 | 常见说法 | 实际含义 |\n|------|----------------|----------------------|\n| LSP | “自动补全引擎” | Language Server Protocol（语言服务器协议）：编辑器从特定语言的服务器获取类型信息、补全和诊断结果的标准 |\n| Pylance | “Python 插件” | Microsoft 的 Python 语言服务器，使用 Pyright 进行类型检查并提供 IntelliSense |\n| Remote SSH | “在服务器上工作” | VS Code 扩展，在远程机器上运行轻量级服务器，将界面传送到本地编辑器 |\n| 保存时格式化 | “自动美化” | 每次保存时，编辑器都会运行格式化工具（Black、Ruff），让代码风格保持一致 |\n"
    }
  ],
